sequenceDiagram
    participant F as founder 频道
    participant P as Discord 插件 0.0.4(旧)
    participant C as flywheel-comm CLI(#35;808 之后)
    F->>P: founder 消息
    P->>F: Lead 回复送达 ✅(功能无损)
    P->>C: chat-receipt settle(老合同)
    C-->>P: Unknown command ❌ exit 1
    P->>P: settle intent 落 spool
    loop 每 3-4 分钟,永不成功
        P->>C: 重试 settle
        C-->>P: Unknown command ❌
    end
    Note over P,F: attempts > 5 后
    P->>F: ⚠️ settlement recovery has failed N times(纯噪音)
